ty measures there is a risk  of hacker exploits which could cost  liquidity providers money  it uses publicly accessible smart  contracts to maintain the transparency  of security audit information but on the  contrary there is an exposure to  Temporary loss  this occurs when a change in the price  of your assets that are held in a  liquidity pool results in an unrealized  loss as opposed to if you had just kept  the Assets in your wallet  well this was all about liquidity pool  and its related Concepts I hope you like  this video and found it interesting and  informative and if you like this video  then please like this video And  subscribe to our YouTube channel and  also if you have any questions related  to this video please feel free to ask in  the comments section our team will reach  out to you as soon as possible thank you  [Music]  hi there if you like this video  subscribe to the simply learned YouTube  channel and click here to watch similar  videos turn it up and get certified  click here

